---
title: "Extensions"
description: "Package reusable Plite schema, reads, updates, APIs, and lifecycle behavior."
---

Extensions package reusable Plite behavior that should be installed, ordered,
and removed as one unit. Plate builds its product-level plugin conventions on
this smaller runtime primitive.

